  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF is UN&apos;s agency for advancing childrens development and rights. Sida&apos;s support via UNICEF in the occupied Palestinian territories is for three projects in two sectors - education and water &amp; sanitation. UNICEF is active in both the Gaza strip and the West bank.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNICEF &#xe4;r FNs organ f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;d till barns utveckling och r&#xe4;ttigheter. Sidas st&#xf6;d via UNICEF i de ockuperade palestinska omr&#xe5;dena &#xe4;r till tre projekt i tv&#xe5; sektorer - utbildning samt vatten/sanitet. UNICEF implementerar insatser b&#xe5;de i Gaza och p&#xe5; V&#xe4;stbanken.</narrative>
  </description>
